@format 1
@id files.select
@title Select media-list item
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Update list selection and current-path state, then publish the selected path so its owning tab can open the media.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@flow TB
@related files.add, files.remove, preview.open-media

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[input] List item selected <input>
- Handle a plain, range, or toggle selection gesture on a media row @ list.PListPressHandle(...)
> selection

[selection] Update selection state <process>
- Apply single, range, or toggle selection and update row highlighting @ list.PListSelectApply(...)
@ list.PListRangeApply(...)
@ list.PListSelectionToggle(...)
> current

[current] Publish current path <output>
- Set the current path and publish the list path-change event @ list.PListCurrentApply(...)
> map:preview.open-media
